PROPRIETARY - ALL RIGHTS RESERVED
=================================

wkdcolor.py and apfx.py in this folder are NOT licensed under the MIT license
of open-uniwill-cc.

They were generated automatically (tools/re/pyport.py, tools/re/apport.py)
from the logic of GCUService.exe of the OEM "Control Center 5.52.49.6"
(LightingModel.WKDColor - LED colour correction per LED vendor;
LM_ITE_RGB.AP_Effect_Task / MyRgbKeyboard.AlphabetEffect - frames of the
software keyboard effects Neon, Stack, Impact, Alphabet), so that the
keyboard shows exactly the same colours and frames as with the original
software.

Copyright (c) Uniwill Technology Inc. and/or the respective laptop
manufacturer (OEM). All rights reserved by their respective owners.

Included solely for interoperability with the laptops this software supports.
The authors of open-uniwill-cc claim no rights to the logic of these files and
grant no license for it. Provided "as is", without warranty of any kind.

Rights holders: to request removal, open an issue at
https://github.com/aspidovss/open-uniwill-cc/issues. Without this folder the
hardware keyboard effects keep working; LED colour correction and the four
software effects are disabled.
